        "public_symbol:aspose.cells_foss.datavalidationtype"
      ],
      "section": "key_capabilities",
      "slot": "capability:3",
      "text": "It adds data validation rules to cell ranges using DataValidation objects with DataValidationType, DataValidationAlertStyle, DataValidationOperator, and formula1 settings to enforce list, numeric, or text constraints."
    },
    {
      "fact_ids": [
        "format:output.csv",
        "format:output.json",
