      ],
      "section": "key_capabilities",
      "slot": "capability:5",
      "text": "It encrypts and decrypts .xlsx workbooks using password-based protection via Workbook.save() with a password argument or Workbook constructor with a password argument; encrypt_xlsx and decrypt_xlsx are convenience functions."
    },
